Package: roadcrashVIC
Title: Explore Victorian Road Crashes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Eduardo", "Vitale", , "eduardo.vitale@studio.unibo.it", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides cleaned Victorian road crash data (casualty crashes, 2012 to February 2026) from the
    Victorian Government open data portal (CC BY 4.0 License), helper functions to filter and summarise crashes by time, 
    place and conditions, and a Shiny dashboard for exploring when and where crashes happen and how severe they are.
